==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Looey is made out of balloons, with his head and torso being yellow. He has light lime green and purple mismatched cheeks, limbs, and balloon ears which are tied shut dark gray rubber bands. The left ear, left leg, right cheek and right arm are purple, while the right ear, right leg, left cheek and left arm are green. He has a yellow balloon tail tied by a dark gray rubber band, and wears a white cropped turtleneck (the neck part hides a black string connecting his head and body, but only [[Twisted Looey|as a Twisted]] does this prominently show) with a green and purple polka dot pattern. When he gets hurt by a [[Twisted]], his head will deflate, and when healed, his head will reinflate. His ears also cartoonishly disconnect from his head as it gets smaller.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Looey is a black-and-white recolor of the Default with eyes pie-cut left. His yellow parts are light gray, his lime green colors are a medium gray, and his purple ones are dark gray.
|-|Dapperly Festive=
Dapperly Festive Looey's smile is "U"-shaped and he has a bright gray head, torso, and tail. His red left ear, right arm, left leg, right cheek, and three left freckles are colored vermillion red, while his right ear, left arm, right leg, left cheek, and three right freckles are fern green. He wears a dark green top hat the same color as the rubber bands tying his ears and tail and his turtleneck is now slightly longer and colored pine green with lighter stripes.
|-|Swirling Mix Up=
Swirling Mix Up Looey is mauve with his lime green balloons recolored light pink and his purple balloons coral pink. He has two wavy stripes on his ears and shoulders, which are colored pastel purple on the light pink parts and violet on the coral pink parts. He also has a pastel purple spiral on his light pink cheek and a violet spiral on the other. His turtleneck has a pastel purple and violet checkered pattern and he has black suspenders that are connected to white shorts with light gray stitches on the waist.
|-|Show-Time=
[[Show-Time Cosmetic Pack|Show-Time]] Looey is a slightly oranger shade for his yellow parts and his lime green parts are while his purple ones are midnight blue. The left ear's band is dark cyan, the right ear's is midnight blue, and the tail which is bent into a lightning-bolt-esque shape has a red band. His smile is arch-shaped and he wears white face paint and a red clown nose. He also wears a white, ruffled collar and smaller white ruffles on his wrists. His turtleneck is longer and dark red, and he has white suspenders with golden, star-shaped adjusters that hold large, red trousers with yellowish polka dots. He has an orange and blue gradient trail of tickets labeled "TICKET," circus tents, circles, triangles, squares, arches, and squiggles. He also produces star-shaped twinkles that are similarly colored.
|-|Creepy Clown=
Creepy Clown Looey's head, torso, and tail are made up of white balloons, while his green balloons are blue, and the balloons parallel are yellow. The bands on the ears and tail are now red. His eyebrow is curved downward and he sports a grin of sharp teeth, giving him a mischievous look. He also has a blue zig-zag on his left cheek, a yellow zig-zag on his right cheek, a crimson clown nose, and what appears to be [[Ichor]] tears under his eyes. He also has Ichor-like splotches on his feet. He wears a puffy shirt with a white, ruffled collar, two white pom-poms, and crimson red stripes that are outlined with vermillion lines.
|-|Marching Band=
Marching Band Looey is cream colored with three green freckles on his cheeks. His ears and tail are white with green stripes and golden colored bands. In between his ears, he dons a red shako with a yellow center and darker bands around it. He wears a red marching band suit with a golden trim on the notched collar and the center, along with six gold buttons on each side, a black string connecting to each. The suit also has large, red sleeves and a golden trim, and he wears white gloves. He wears crimson pants with darker, vertical stripes, and red boots with a golden trim.
|-|Pastel Patterns=
Pastel Patterns Looey's cheeks are pink and his yellow balloons are white, while his right ear is pastel pink and left ear pastel green, and he now sports pastel yellow eyeshadow on top of his right eye and pastel purple eyeshadow on the left. His legs and arms respectively are colored alike, but the left colors are right colors and vice versa. He has a double-layered, light turquoise, ruffled collar and his turtleneck's dots are pastel shades of pink, green, yellow, and purple. His rubber bands are also dark pink, and he has light turquoise bows with a tissue-like tail on his pink ear and on the base of his tail. He wears pink pants with dark pink vertical stripes, puffy lower halves, and light turquoise ruffles as hems. He produces falling confetti particles in various shades of pink from his torso.
|-|Funny Bunny=
Funny Bunny Looey is mostly white with with light orange limbs and cheeks. He has ears resembling carrots, being orange with two lighter stripes and green-yellow, jagged, leafy ends. He has a red spiral shape on his left cheek, a cyan star shape on his right cheek, and three orange lines on top of his right eye, resembling eyelashes His turtleneck is green like his "leaves" and has more polka dots, all of which are the predominant orange shade of his ears. His tail, tied by an orange band, is shortened to a sphere, much like a rabbit's tail, and appears more rabbit-like with his buck-toothed smile, followed by more gleeful eyes.
|-|Scribbled Prank=
Scribbled Prank Looey is pastel yellow with a cyan left ear, right arm, and left leg, while the opposite parts are red. He has an orange scribble on the lower half of his turtleneck and an orange stripe on the collar. An orange note with the text "KICK ME" written in black is taped with a piece of gray tape on his back. His red parts have a cyan zig-zag stripe, while his cyan parts have a red wavy stripe. 
