**This is because they were the only non-Christmas Toons with optimized models as of [[Changelog|v0.5.1]].
**Despite already having Christmas Skins, Looey and Connie received one new Skin each.
*Looey is one of the four non-[[Easter Toons]] to be the first to have an [[Easter]] [[Skin]], the others being [[Yatta]], [[Pebble]], and [[Connie]].
**This is because they were the only non-Easter Toons with optimized models as of [[Changelog|v0.7.1]].
*Upon getting killed, Looey has a pop sound effect along with the [[Ichor]] splash. Looey has visible air bursts upon getting hit or killed. He is the first one to have an effect when dying, followed by [[Yatta]].
*Looey's tail wags when he's happy, while {{CI|Scraps|name=true}}' tail wags when she's angry, as confirmed by their dialogue together.
*Looey is the first [[Toon]] to be unofficially revealed, having his model shown in [[i manimator]]'s inventory. Their inventory was then later privated due to the accident. His upcoming appearance was teased after the incident, allowing fanarts of the Toon to be made.
*Looey, alongside [[Connie]], were released with a functioning blink and custom run animation early, as to show what's in store for the rest of the [[Toons]] while they're being updated over time. This makes them the first Toons to have optimized animations.
