*Looey had two concept arts, with the only difference being the first concept art had no eyebrow and the second concept art having a single eyebrow added.<ref>https://discordapp.com/channels/969934252844138496/1251545388259741768/1321280368716025937</ref>
*Looey is one of four [[Toons]] who had one of their [[Skins]] designed by someone else other than [[Qwel]] or [[Ramblesnake]], his being {{Skin|Dapperly Festive}}. The others being {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} with {{Skin|Ebony Detective}}, {{CI|Goob|name=true}} with {{Skin|Special Spaghetti}}, and [[Yatta]] with {{Skin|Choco Cones}}.
*{{CI|Flutter|name=true}} exposes Looey for writing in a diary when she interacts with him.
